<title>USA: News America Holdings sets $200 mln in bonds.</title>
<headline>News America Holdings sets $200 mln in bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue was priced on Thursday, said lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p>BORROWER NEWS AMERICA HOLDINGS INC</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 7.43 PCT   MATURITY 10/01/26</p>
<p>TYPE PUTABLE BONDS ISS PRICE 100.00  FULL FEES STD $6.50</p>
<p>LAST MOODY BAA3    SPREAD +78 BP     PUTABLE IN 10TH YEAR</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB	 YIELD 7.43 PCT</p>
<p>UNDERLYING: 7.00 PERCENT U.S. TREASURY NOTE DUE JULY 2006</p>
</text>
